{"id":2952,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>六月仲夏，骊歌轻起。6月12日晚，信息与通信工程学院（人工智能学院）2026届毕业典礼暨学位授予仪式在科艺苑隆重举行。学院院长王黎明、副院长陈友兴、副院长李剑、电子与通信工程系主任姚金杰、生物医学工程系主任张权、各本科专业负责人、2026届全体毕业生及毕业班班主任共同参加了典礼。典礼由学院党委副书记么兰主持。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=hUml3PU4QRMmvPLBRAVLzNanmCaUNlGPnRnRL8WVU8UiU8-0gihFp2hmCIa0nSybLSyPL1hfMzvbMRLZo7V7UmnRnRUZnmv8Lm-iLNUiozAFL8CDLm78M8MFM87sL4LJqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47ZL4vbgtA8pUfcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18379&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/E9112A5794388ADB4CD48F742252D598/3F62147C/7A733\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=hMz93bUzUDUlQfUBzGPUl7PUmlPM7LGPMRNbMNrfnNrRMlC0gihFp2hmCIa0LSyYokysUYyDo7VfL7l4M8-ZU8MkMzMfUmfVMRnVUmf7nNQFozUsL8-bU4VFL8C4MRA7gtXaQ4Oeo4xZ_dT8_26mgDTJQty0LzGYLYyPoRLsoSbw62f8c&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18379&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=hnzU3Zoz-YUzliLB462nzlDMNCDLRvGYoz7bM7QRM7W2LzC0gihFp2hmCIa0MYhfnkyiLYyZnNLYUzT2M8n2LRGbnm-4U8UPnmTfoRC8LmVFLRG4o7CDMzrFMmW2MR7Jqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47ZL4vbgtA8pUfcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18379&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/7AD538FC2A9F7DF009F23CD1F9A86421/0038F655/62F41\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=hMzQ37M8l8LmlioB7rVUNLaMz9DLlQG7UzVfLRV2M49bLlL0gihFp2hmCIa0Lky4MkybLky4Ul-8MR6VUN7ZM7V7o7LZMz94L8V7UmC8MNWFUmLDnmviM4MFozlsLz7sgtXaQ4Oeo4xZ_dT8_26mgDTJQty0LzGYLYyPoRLsoSbw62f8c&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18379&e=.jpg\"></p><p>随着雄壮的国歌声奏响，典礼正式拉开帷幕。副院长陈友兴宣读了《中北大学优秀毕业生表彰决定》。副院长李剑宣读了《2026届毕业生校友联络员聘任决定》主席台领导依次为校友联络员颁发聘书。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=hMll3sMRA7nRNiUBmUbM7lZMz-Yol7GPUzUiM8V7olWfL4G0gihFp2hmCIa0n1y4MSh2U1ysoRCZUm-iL46RU8r2ozGaUN7bUlW2nmviL4QFnm98L7CZL4rFL8L4oRCJqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47ZL4vbgtA8pUfcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18379&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/F35FB7868B2537CCEF900BA9ABFF7536/F840F835/3C386\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=hM4G3ZMRnko7CaMB4viMRrfLzGiL8WGVL87YLR-8UzMfnzN0gihFp2hmCIa0USyPUYhfUYyPLzTVnzUiLR7ZnmLZU4Q7LzNaLmNiLRMRMlWFMlWVLz7DMzAFLlCaLN-ZgtXaQ4Oeo4xZ_dT8_26mgDTJQty0LzGYLYyPoRLsoSbw62f8c&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18379&e=.jpg\"></p><p>毕业生代表柳力戬同学在发言中深情回顾四年求学之路，从初入校园的青涩到斩获9项国家级奖项的蜕变，表达了对母校与师长的诚挚感恩。在校生代表孟轲同学为即将远航的学长学姐送上祝福，表示将接续奋斗，续写信通学院的青春华章。荣获“山西青年五四奖章”的教师代表张瑞教授以“师兄”身份殷切寄语，勉励同学们学会交流与合作，坚守初心，做纯粹的追梦人。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=hM7Q3fUmN8olC4MBNWfMmv4nzMRL7nGRU8Q7UN7inz78UlL0gihFp2hmCIa0okyZM1h2MSy8nzfVM4vinNrVUzCiL4lZol7sL47bM4A7L4AFLRQ7Uz-aoRWFM7LYLmlJqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47ZL4vbgtA8pUfcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18379&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/886F54E0E775FEEA653589A731978D38/06DA2082/4C225\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=hM7Q3fUmN8olC4MBNWfMmv4nzMRL7nGRU8Q7UN7inz78UlL0gihFp2hmCIa0okyZM1h2MSy8nzfVM4vinNrVUzCiL4lZol7sL47bM4A7L4AFLRQ7Uz-aoRWFM7LYLmlJqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47ZL4vbgtA8pUfcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18379&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=hMmr3VU4MRU4A2LBzUPUmNDnz9DUm7Gsn7nVoRlsn7l4oz70gihFp2hmCIa0UYyZUSyaL1h7UzWfolV2ozUsLmU4UN7iM47ZL4nkMRvPL7nFo7lsL4NiLNMFMR6VMmUJqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47ZL4vbgtA8pUfcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18379&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/C8A02DA2A9AF947243BA571834B4710D/8E73952C/47E64\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=hMmr3VU4MRU4A2LBzUPUmNDnz9DUm7Gsn7nVoRlsn7l4oz70gihFp2hmCIa0UYyZUSyaL1h7UzWfolV2ozUsLmU4UN7iM47ZL4nkMRvPL7nFo7lsL4NiLNMFMR6VMmUJqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47ZL4vbgtA8pUfcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18379&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=hnmC3ZUz6fnzG4LBN-ZnzGZM7U4M8-GaL8LDUNMVL7lDMz-0gihFp2hmCIa0UYysUYyPLShVM8UYoRLZozA2M8MfnmGboz6knR6VUz98MzMFUNrRLlCiLRfFLmVVL7LJqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47ZL4vbgtA8pUfcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18379&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/C7C11E7D283898F7CAF0997BD7EA8453/BEC1F500/21E0C\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=hnmC3ZUz6fnzG4LBN-ZnzGZM7U4M8-GaL8LDUNMVL7lDMz-0gihFp2hmCIa0UYysUYyPLShVM8UYoRLZozA2M8MfnmGboz6knR6VUz98MzMFUNrRLlCiLRfFLmVVL7LJqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47ZL4vbgtA8pUfcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18379&e=.jpg\"></p><p>院长王黎明向全体毕业生提出三点期望：第一，赓续红色基因，立志做大事，在各自岗位上做对国家、人民和社会有益的事；第二，永葆赤诚之心，在面对瓶颈与挑战时守住内心的热忱与坚韧；第三，扎根成长、一往无前，以中北人的奋斗底色书写无悔青春。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=hUzG3PU4r2L8l4oBRn2nNLaLNQfUmWGVM8liL4L4ozUDLzL0gihFp2hmCIa0LShVokyPnSysLmffolU8oRV7n7UPnz-4L4AVozQkUNUbLzrFM87PUzUao7WFMRAVLR9Jqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47ZL4vbgtA8pUfcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18379&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/1E81E720A9D481DDD1E2338E96BBD915/7A1A408B/48E08\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=hUzG3PU4r2L8l4oBRn2nNLaLNQfUmWGVM8liL4L4ozUDLzL0gihFp2hmCIa0LShVokyPnSysLmffolU8oRV7n7UPnz-4L4AVozQkUNUbLzrFM87PUzUao7WFMRAVLR9Jqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47ZL4vbgtA8pUfcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18379&e=.jpg\"></p><p>盛典终章，荣光汇聚。学院领导为博士、硕士、学士学位获得者正冠拨穗，授予证书。穗垂流苏，见证学有所成；方寸文凭，镌刻求索荣光。全场师生共同唱响青春之歌，用歌声为即将远行的信通学子送上最温暖的祝福。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=hMm73iUmVknm7YoBz7aLNrfo7UaozGGZo7rRMR6Rnm9YnRU0gihFp2hmCIa0oShRMShRLYy4Lzvin7L8nN7ZUmf2U4CYMRv4U87YL7nRL8MFM4-ZnNLPnNQFMRQRnl7Jqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47ZL4vbgtA8pUfcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18379&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/9C5C33175DC4FA8B0FC62473CA20DC3C/728FC1FF/46CEA\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=hMN-3PL8-8MzAVMBl-sMRliUzLZozlGsUm-Yo7MVMRLZo7L0gihFp2hmCIa0M1hkU1ysMYyZMl7PU4r7nzvYL4f7o7lZoR7DozNbM4nkL4rFM8VfLmUsozTFoRUPnN7ZgtXaQ4Oeo4xZ_dT8_26mgDTJQty0LzGYLYyPoRLsoSbw62f8c&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18379&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=hLRv3Zoz7DL77DMBNlZLzvYoR9bMmfGkLNUaL8LbU8CPnz70gihFp2hmCIa0LkhfnSy4UShVLl7DnmW2n